1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Princess Knight,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Twentieth Episode
The Shadow Eaters

15
00:02:09,581 --> 00:02:12,937
I see you like listening
to music, eh, little sheep?

16
00:02:14,461 --> 00:02:17,453
Let's go! Let's go for a walk!

17
00:02:17,501 --> 00:02:19,571
- Let's go for a walk!
- Hey, friends!

18
00:02:19,621 --> 00:02:21,452
Can I know where you are going?

19
00:02:21,501 --> 00:02:23,890
Hello, Choppy! We are
going to listen to a legend...

20
00:02:23,941 --> 00:02:26,660
...from an old inhabitant of the
forest! Why don't you come too?

21
00:02:26,701 --> 00:02:29,579
Oh, how wonderful!
I like legends so much!

22
00:02:29,621 --> 00:02:31,293
Yes, I'm coming too!

23
00:02:33,741 --> 00:02:36,892
Ouch, what a blow!
I really hurt myself!

24
00:02:38,701 --> 00:02:41,579
Sure, I play the flute, but
don't look at me like that!

25
00:02:49,101 --> 00:02:51,490
Alright, I will play
something sweeter.

26
00:03:14,221 --> 00:03:17,258
What kind of story would
you like to hear today, children?

27
00:03:17,301 --> 00:03:19,417
I would like to hear
a story about pirates.

28
00:03:19,461 --> 00:03:21,656
No, pirates are not
interesting anymore.

29
00:03:21,701 --> 00:03:24,169
I, instead, would like to
hear the story of a Princess.

30
00:03:24,901 --> 00:03:28,337
Here I am! Wait!
Let me listen too!

31
00:03:28,381 --> 00:03:30,099
Help!

32
00:03:30,301 --> 00:03:34,010
My boy, there was no need for
you to rush over with such haste.

33
00:03:34,061 --> 00:03:36,416
But I must continue
to watch the sheep.

34
00:03:36,461 --> 00:03:39,692
After listening to the
story, I am forced to run off.

35
00:03:39,741 --> 00:03:42,858
I took a little time off to
be able to hear your story.

36
00:03:42,901 --> 00:03:45,335
Do you think it is right
to take this liberty...

37
00:03:45,381 --> 00:03:47,690
...while you watch the flock?
- But it's only for a short time!

38
00:03:47,741 --> 00:03:51,290
So, since it seems everyone
has arrived, I can begin.

39
00:03:51,861 --> 00:03:53,931
- Yes, come on, begin!
- Good, good!

40
00:03:53,981 --> 00:03:57,257
Today I will tell you the
story of the shadow eaters.

41
00:03:57,301 --> 00:03:59,690
- Shadow eaters?!
- That's right, my children.

42
00:03:59,741 --> 00:04:02,335
Do not be surprised,
now, by this term.

43
00:04:02,381 --> 00:04:04,656
In fact, later, you
will understand why.

44
00:04:04,741 --> 00:04:07,414
Well then. You must know
that once upon a time,

45
00:04:07,461 --> 00:04:10,373
when there were few living
creatures on Earth,

46
00:04:10,421 --> 00:04:14,653
it was natural that they could not
easily find each other.

47
00:04:14,821 --> 00:04:17,654
As a consequence, it happened
that all living creatures...

48
00:04:17,701 --> 00:04:19,612
...felt lonely.

49
00:04:20,141 --> 00:04:24,293
None of them had friends
and many cried all day long,

50
00:04:24,621 --> 00:04:27,738
so they were all depressed
and almost always sick.

51
00:04:28,021 --> 00:04:30,581
So the Lord
began to worry.

52
00:04:30,621 --> 00:04:33,419
...and thought that if he
provided them with friends,

53
00:04:33,461 --> 00:04:35,895
they would return
to good health.

54
00:04:36,021 --> 00:04:38,581
That was how the Lord
created shadows.

55
00:04:38,821 --> 00:04:41,096
But one day the shadows disappeared...

56
00:04:41,141 --> 00:04:43,814
...and men plunged back
into depression.

57
00:04:44,021 --> 00:04:46,694
Then the Lord,
thinking it over and over,

58
00:04:46,741 --> 00:04:48,538
found the solution once again...

59
00:04:48,581 --> 00:04:51,095
...and attached the shadows
to the feet of men,

60
00:04:51,141 --> 00:04:53,530
so they could no longer
be stolen...

61
00:04:53,581 --> 00:04:57,096
...and finally they could have
friends forever.

62
00:04:57,141 --> 00:05:00,656
Since then, shadows became
people's best friends,

63
00:05:00,701 --> 00:05:05,650
but since then they also aroused the
appetites of the shadow eaters.

64
00:05:22,141 --> 00:05:25,497
Good heavens! Those sheep
have wandered away from the flock!

65
00:05:27,021 --> 00:05:31,412
What a hassle...! I have to
go and get those two back!

66
00:05:33,581 --> 00:05:35,890
Look, there's something in
the lake! What could it be?

67
00:05:45,421 --> 00:05:47,537
It's a monster!

68
00:05:56,501 --> 00:05:58,810
It ate the sheep's shadow!

69
00:05:58,861 --> 00:06:01,216
That must be
the shadow eater!

70
00:06:09,661 --> 00:06:13,336
It might come towards us!
You'd better run away, children!

71
00:06:13,380 --> 00:06:16,134
- Help! Help!
- Let's run!

72
00:06:23,340 --> 00:06:26,094
Now it has seen us, guys!
We'd better run!

73
00:06:42,300 --> 00:06:44,212
Choppy, run faster!

74
00:06:50,620 --> 00:06:52,612
Look, there's a house!

75
00:06:57,300 --> 00:07:01,294
Listen to me carefully: let's not be
heard! Stay quiet and still!

76
00:07:01,500 --> 00:07:03,810
Sapphire, the monsters are
approaching the house!

77
00:07:03,860 --> 00:07:05,817
Quickly, Choppy, bar the door!

78
00:07:20,020 --> 00:07:22,774
- Choppy, we must also bar
the windows! - Alright!

79
00:07:25,780 --> 00:07:27,817
That window was left unbarred!

80
00:07:29,500 --> 00:07:31,219
There it is!

81
00:07:47,300 --> 00:07:49,610
Watch out, the roof is collapsing!

82
00:07:50,580 --> 00:07:52,890
It's dangerous here! We must get out!

83
00:07:56,020 --> 00:07:59,138
I'll try to stop it! You get out
while I am fighting!

84
00:08:03,820 --> 00:08:06,415
Damned shadow eater,
I do not fear you!

85
00:08:17,620 --> 00:08:19,339
I fell into a hole!

86
00:08:22,420 --> 00:08:24,889
Good heavens!
I fell into an old well!

87
00:08:24,940 --> 00:08:29,014
- Help! Mom! Help!
- Help!

88
00:08:29,580 --> 00:08:31,731
What's going on down there?
Let's see...

89
00:08:31,900 --> 00:08:35,416
- Come, we must escape!
- The monster took my shadow!

90
00:08:36,620 --> 00:08:39,215
Help! Let's escape!

91
00:08:39,900 --> 00:08:43,018
- Let's run! Let's run!
- Run! Run!

92
00:08:45,141 --> 00:08:47,860
No! Damn it!
It ate my shadow too!

93
00:08:47,901 --> 00:08:49,732
Those monsters are interesting:

94
00:08:49,781 --> 00:08:51,260
the male eats
the boys' shadows,

95
00:08:51,301 --> 00:08:53,690
the female eats the girls'!
I'll show them Sapphire!

96
00:08:53,741 --> 00:08:55,811
Damn, he's already here!

97
00:08:57,141 --> 00:08:59,018
We'd better run for it!

98
00:08:59,461 --> 00:09:01,497
But where is my horse's head?

99
00:09:02,181 --> 00:09:05,093
No! No, please!
Mine is a cheap shadow!

100
00:09:05,141 --> 00:09:07,018
It's indigestible, can't you see?

101
00:09:08,341 --> 00:09:11,413
Out of the way! Make way! Out of the way!

102
00:09:11,541 --> 00:09:15,614
Choppy, are you okay?
Hey, is there no one up there?

103
00:09:19,741 --> 00:09:23,529
Choppy, can you hear
me? Is anyone up there?

104
00:09:31,821 --> 00:09:35,860
You're here! Thank
heaven! You're safe!

105
00:09:36,101 --> 00:09:38,410
I thought something had
happened to you!

106
00:09:38,461 --> 00:09:41,817
Now I'm relieved.
Thank you for saving me.

107
00:09:41,861 --> 00:09:44,216
If it weren't for you,
I don't know what I would have done!

108
00:09:46,821 --> 00:09:50,257
Well? What's going on now?
Why all this crying?

109
00:09:50,421 --> 00:09:52,810
Choppy, what on earth happened to you guys?

110
00:09:52,861 --> 00:09:55,011
The monsters ate
our shadows!

111
00:09:55,061 --> 00:09:57,256
Damn!
So they succeeded

112
00:09:58,141 --> 00:10:01,258
The shadow-eating monster...
Let's see here...

113
00:10:01,301 --> 00:10:03,212
Here it is, I found it!
It's him, right?

114
00:10:03,261 --> 00:10:05,331
- Yes, it's really him.
- His name is Kagera...

115
00:10:05,381 --> 00:10:07,611
...and he loves to eat the shadows
of humans and animals.

116
00:10:07,661 --> 00:10:11,210
Originally, it seems he was a giant
snail that lived in lakes.

117
00:10:11,261 --> 00:10:14,492
What will happen to the children whose
shadows were eaten by the monsters?

118
00:10:14,541 --> 00:10:16,736
400 years ago,
the same thing happened...

119
00:10:16,781 --> 00:10:19,614
and it says here that those children
died the next day.

120
00:10:19,741 --> 00:10:23,017
They died?! Doctor, doesn't it say there
if there's a way to save them?

121
00:10:23,061 --> 00:10:25,017
There is, but it's very difficult!

122
00:10:25,061 --> 00:10:28,337
Let's take all the children of this
city to safety underground!

123
00:10:39,901 --> 00:10:43,610
The monsters won't get them! I must
succeed in saving these children!

124
00:10:43,741 --> 00:10:46,096
Look out!
The monsters are coming!

125
00:10:53,021 --> 00:10:54,818
Where are the monsters?

126
00:10:54,861 --> 00:10:56,817
- They are heading towards the city!
- I don't have much time!

127
00:10:56,861 --> 00:10:59,056
The male monsters
eat the boys' shadows,

128
00:10:59,101 --> 00:11:01,012
the female ones
eat those of the girls.

129
00:11:01,061 --> 00:11:03,416
The monster that will want
Sapphire's shadow, what will it be like?

130
00:11:07,301 --> 00:11:10,020
Damn, there's a female too!

131
00:11:28,421 --> 00:11:31,891
Don't shoot! If they don't die,
they will destroy the castle!

132
00:11:31,941 --> 00:11:34,455
We must try
to get them away from the castle!

133
00:11:34,501 --> 00:11:36,412
- Yes, but how?
- I will act as bait!

134
00:11:36,461 --> 00:11:39,021
I will get the monsters to follow me
up the mountain!

135
00:11:39,061 --> 00:11:41,495
It's the only way
to drive them away from here.

136
00:11:41,541 --> 00:11:45,011
- Prince, can I come with you?
- All right, come along.

137
00:11:45,141 --> 00:11:50,010
It will be interesting to see which
monster is attracted by your shadow!

138
00:11:50,541 --> 00:11:53,214
- What?!
- What? Don't you know?

139
00:11:53,261 --> 00:11:55,456
The male monster
craves the shadows of boys,

140
00:11:55,501 --> 00:11:57,457
the female, instead,
those of girls

141
00:11:57,501 --> 00:12:00,174
We will see how they behave
in front of you.

142
00:12:00,821 --> 00:12:02,493
Well, let's go now!

143
00:12:03,221 --> 00:12:05,132
What's wrong, Prince?

144
00:12:30,421 --> 00:12:32,013
Here they are!

145
00:12:32,061 --> 00:12:35,019
Come on, monsters!
Try to take my shadow!

146
00:12:35,381 --> 00:12:38,293
Interesting! The male monster
doesn't seem interested in you!

147
00:12:41,741 --> 00:12:43,459
Help!

148
00:12:46,901 --> 00:12:49,415
I'll take you to the
mountain! You'll be safe there!

149
00:12:49,461 --> 00:12:51,099
Let's get out of here!

150
00:12:52,581 --> 00:12:54,253
Run away, Neelon!

151
00:12:54,901 --> 00:12:56,812
The monster is chasing me!

152
00:13:01,941 --> 00:13:04,535
Neelon, don't run
towards the castle!

153
00:13:05,901 --> 00:13:07,812
Now Kagera will go to the castle...

154
00:13:15,221 --> 00:13:16,813
Kagera!

155
00:13:17,501 --> 00:13:20,459
I am your enemy! Come
on, take my shadow!

156
00:13:32,781 --> 00:13:35,659
This time Prince
Sapphire won't escape!

157
00:13:35,701 --> 00:13:39,011
Go on, kill him! Good
monster! Try to catch him!

158
00:13:39,061 --> 00:13:42,019
Like that! Yes, yes, good! Eat it!

159
00:13:43,021 --> 00:13:44,818
I will help Zaffiro!

160
00:14:02,101 --> 00:14:05,298
Help, Choppy!
Raise the drawbridge!

161
00:14:21,221 --> 00:14:23,416
Please, Choppy, recover

162
00:14:23,901 --> 00:14:26,415
Everyone go take shelter
in the basement.

163
00:14:26,461 --> 00:14:30,090
I will manage to destroy the monsters
and return your shadows to you!

164
00:14:35,101 --> 00:14:37,217
My head! It's so heavy!

165
00:14:37,261 --> 00:14:39,536
I have never seen
something so heavy!

166
00:14:41,421 --> 00:14:44,015
My pinky!
It grabbed my pinky!

167
00:14:44,061 --> 00:14:45,255
It hurts!

168
00:14:46,821 --> 00:14:48,937
It was the female
that was hunting Zaffiro!

169
00:14:48,981 --> 00:14:52,018
- Just as I thought!
- There is a child in the park!

170
00:14:52,061 --> 00:14:54,814
- What do we care about that child?
- But he is your son!

171
00:14:54,861 --> 00:14:56,453
What?!

172
00:14:56,501 --> 00:14:59,811
My son! It's really my son!
It's Plastic!

173
00:15:00,541 --> 00:15:03,009
Quick, someone run
to help my son!

174
00:15:08,221 --> 00:15:10,257
Oh, no! No!

175
00:15:10,501 --> 00:15:13,652
My shadow!
Leave my shadow alone!

176
00:15:14,581 --> 00:15:19,097
Oh, it's gone! What do I do,
now, without my shadow?

177
00:15:19,941 --> 00:15:22,819
That monster has eaten
Plastic's shadow!

178
00:15:36,821 --> 00:15:39,335
Come, Plastic! Don't cry!

179
00:15:39,381 --> 00:15:41,372
Look, the monsters are sleeping!

180
00:15:42,821 --> 00:15:45,210
My son! My son!

181
00:15:47,021 --> 00:15:49,535
How are you, my son?
Are you alright?

182
00:15:52,021 --> 00:15:53,659
Come!

183
00:15:57,261 --> 00:15:59,252
What happened, Geralamon?

184
00:15:59,301 --> 00:16:01,371
Even my son's shadow
has been eaten.

185
00:16:01,421 --> 00:16:05,016
- Where are the monsters?
- They are sleeping in the garden.

186
00:16:05,621 --> 00:16:08,135
I see! The sun is setting
and the shadow does not appear,

187
00:16:08,181 --> 00:16:11,491
so they are resting.
Good, now is the right time!

188
00:16:13,661 --> 00:16:16,095
- Oh, hello, Prince!
- Doctor, have you found...

189
00:16:16,141 --> 00:16:18,371
...the way to get the shadow back?
- Yes, I have found it,

190
00:16:18,421 --> 00:16:21,731
but this doesn't seem like a good
method. In fact, it's impossible!

191
00:16:21,901 --> 00:16:24,620
We must use it anyway.
Tell me, what is it about?

192
00:16:24,661 --> 00:16:27,016
The book says that
if we destroy the two monsters,

193
00:16:27,061 --> 00:16:29,734
the shadows will return immediately,
but, unfortunately, the only one...

194
00:16:29,781 --> 00:16:32,341
...who can succeed
in destroying them is the devil.

195
00:16:32,381 --> 00:16:34,337
- The devil?!
- Yes, indeed.

196
00:16:34,381 --> 00:16:36,895
The book says that
if we offer him as a sacrifice..

197
00:16:36,941 --> 00:16:40,013
...what he desires most,
he will destroy the monsters...

198
00:16:40,061 --> 00:16:42,700
...and will return all the shadows
to their place.

199
00:16:42,741 --> 00:16:45,858
What can the devil desire
above all else?

200
00:17:06,021 --> 00:17:08,819
Satan, Prince of Darkness,
listen to me!

201
00:17:08,861 --> 00:17:11,853
I want to speak to you!
Come out! I am Zaffiro!

202
00:17:11,901 --> 00:17:14,734
Answer! Zaffiro wants to speak to you!

203
00:17:15,021 --> 00:17:17,012
Welcome, Zaffiro!

204
00:17:17,061 --> 00:17:21,054
Follow the light of the torch
and I will listen to what you have to tell me!

205
00:17:28,901 --> 00:17:31,893
And so you must ask me
for a favor, isn't that right?

206
00:17:32,661 --> 00:17:36,370
Ask for anything you desire!
Satan can do anything!

207
00:17:36,421 --> 00:17:39,891
Even if Heaven were to burn
and the Earth were destroyed,

208
00:17:39,941 --> 00:17:43,138
we devils will never die, as
long as a tiny flame exists!

209
00:17:43,181 --> 00:17:46,890
Now tell me what you desire
and I will tell you my conditions!

210
00:17:46,941 --> 00:17:49,899
You must destroy the
shadow-eating monsters.

211
00:17:50,101 --> 00:17:54,856
Kagera? Even Sapphire seems
frightened by that monster!

212
00:17:55,021 --> 00:17:57,489
All right, it is very easy for me.

213
00:17:57,861 --> 00:18:01,615
But in exchange for
my help, I want to have...

214
00:18:01,661 --> 00:18:04,221
Yes, I know what you want!
All right, I will give it to you!

215
00:18:04,261 --> 00:18:06,172
You will have my boy's heart.

216
00:18:06,621 --> 00:18:10,057
Sapphire, you are a
Prince truly very generous!

217
00:18:12,581 --> 00:18:16,574
Zelda, destroy Kagera and bring me
Sapphire's male heart!

218
00:18:22,661 --> 00:18:25,016
Instead of finding out
if Sapphire is a girl,

219
00:18:25,061 --> 00:18:27,017
you attracted the monsters...

220
00:18:27,061 --> 00:18:29,700
..and they broke my son's
little toe.

221
00:18:30,461 --> 00:18:33,214
Look, the sun is about to rise!

222
00:18:33,261 --> 00:18:35,650
With the sun,
the monsters will wake up!

223
00:18:41,661 --> 00:18:45,176
Baron, Neelon, you are nothing but
a useless idiot!

224
00:18:45,221 --> 00:18:48,133
- Yes, Yes! Yes! Yes!
- Grand Duke, behind you!

225
00:18:48,901 --> 00:18:51,574
Here we are safe,
because there is no shadow.

226
00:18:55,381 --> 00:18:58,339
Even in the water there is no
shadow, therefore they cannot eat.

227
00:19:11,501 --> 00:19:14,538
Sapphire, help me get
Kagera out of the castle.

228
00:19:14,581 --> 00:19:16,890
Hey, stupid Kagera! Come out!

229
00:19:17,141 --> 00:19:18,893
It heard us!

230
00:19:18,941 --> 00:19:20,818
Leave it to me! Let's run!

231
00:19:22,341 --> 00:19:24,172
What do you want me to do?

232
00:19:24,781 --> 00:19:27,341
- First, get off your horse!
- Alright!

233
00:19:32,861 --> 00:19:35,614
This is the elixir that makes
the shadow stick to the ground.

234
00:19:39,941 --> 00:19:41,852
Now let's leave quietly.

235
00:19:43,741 --> 00:19:46,938
It's surprising how my
shadow is sticking to me.

236
00:19:47,901 --> 00:19:51,337
In a little while, it will get
interesting. Look! Water for me!

237
00:19:56,901 --> 00:20:00,098
Down!
Now, sugar for me!

238
00:20:01,901 --> 00:20:03,812
Pour it in!

239
00:20:04,501 --> 00:20:06,696
- What do you want to do?
- You will know soon.

240
00:20:06,741 --> 00:20:09,414
Give me a spoon!
Stir the water!

241
00:20:12,541 --> 00:20:15,009
What do you intend to
do with the sugar water?

242
00:20:15,061 --> 00:20:17,370
This seems to me
a strange spell!

243
00:20:17,421 --> 00:20:19,412
A broom for you!

244
00:20:19,461 --> 00:20:22,533
Apply the sugar water with
this to the shadow of Kagera!

245
00:20:27,581 --> 00:20:30,732
I wonder what use it
can be, this sugar water.

246
00:20:44,221 --> 00:20:46,815
There, Zelda!
I did as you ordered.

247
00:20:50,701 --> 00:20:54,250
Good, they have begun to
eat the shadow. Water, rise!

248
00:21:01,021 --> 00:21:03,740
Now pay attention. You'll
see how I will destroy them!

249
00:21:03,781 --> 00:21:06,215
They are eating
their own shadow.

250
00:21:17,661 --> 00:21:20,733
Soon that sugar water
will become salt water.

251
00:21:22,221 --> 00:21:24,018
My God!

252
00:21:25,061 --> 00:21:28,690
Since Kagera is nothing but a
huge snail, it will melt with the salt.

253
00:21:55,941 --> 00:21:58,250
Hooray! Hooray, we are saved!

254
00:21:58,821 --> 00:22:03,019
The shadow is back! Hooray!
Hooray! How wonderful!

255
00:22:06,181 --> 00:22:09,253
The shadow has returned! Thank
goodness! You are safe, my son!

256
00:22:09,301 --> 00:22:12,338
Plastic, you are safe! You
are safe! How wonderful!

257
00:22:12,381 --> 00:22:15,418
Hooray! Hooray! Plastic
is safe! Hooray! Hooray!

258
00:22:15,461 --> 00:22:18,533
Hooray! Hooray!
The shadow is back!

259
00:22:21,541 --> 00:22:24,851
Now, Zelda, as promised,
you can even take my heart.

260
00:22:24,901 --> 00:22:26,937
All right.
A tree for me!

261
00:22:31,261 --> 00:22:33,729
Sapphire, mount this one
and come with me!

262
00:22:36,261 --> 00:22:38,013
Sapphire!

263
00:22:38,421 --> 00:22:41,618
That is the devil! Sapphire
has been taken by the devil!

264
00:22:49,741 --> 00:22:52,619
I couldn't wait
for this day to come!

265
00:22:52,661 --> 00:22:56,370
- Sapphire, are you ready?
- No, Satan! Stop!

266
00:22:56,421 --> 00:22:59,538
It's that angel!
Stay away from me!

267
00:22:59,581 --> 00:23:02,698
If you want to take the heart of
Sapphire, you will have to fight us!

268
00:23:02,741 --> 00:23:05,414
I destroyed Kagera
and the deal was...

269
00:23:05,461 --> 00:23:07,850
...that I could take
Sapphire's heart!

270
00:23:07,901 --> 00:23:11,689
I will give you my heart instead of
hers, and I will give it to you now! Hurry!

271
00:23:12,021 --> 00:23:14,854
Go away!
My body is paralyzed!

272
00:23:14,901 --> 00:23:17,734
Zelda, run! Cheat!

273
00:23:20,301 --> 00:23:23,930
I am glad that you kept
your boy's heart, Sapphire.

274
00:23:23,981 --> 00:23:25,972
We are both safe now!

275
00:23:26,581 --> 00:23:28,299
Goodbye!

276
00:23:31,301 --> 00:23:33,098
How wonderful Zelda is...!

277
00:23:33,181 --> 00:23:36,412
Goodbye, friend! See you! Goodbye!

278
00:23:56,340 --> 00:23:59,960
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

279
00:23:59,961 --> 00:24:03,321
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

280
00:24:03,322 --> 00:24:07,092
♪ Tarari Ratta Ritta Ratta Rattattaa ♪
-

281
00:24:07,093 --> 00:24:10,254
♪ Kyahoo! Kyahoo! Kyahoo! ♪
Yahoo! Yahoo! Yahoo!

282
00:24:10,255 --> 00:24:14,068
♪ Sen'nen man'nen hyakuman-nen ♪
A thousand years, ten thousand years, a million years,

283
00:24:14,069 --> 00:24:17,365
♪ Ribbon de tsunagou ichioku-nen ♪
Let’s connect with ribbons for a billion years!

284
00:24:17,366 --> 00:24:21,371
♪ Akuma ga kute mo arashi ga kute mo ♪
Even if devils come, even if storms arrive,

285
00:24:21,372 --> 00:24:24,810
♪ tsunaida kokoro wa hanarenai ♪
Our bonded hearts will never part.

286
00:24:24,811 --> 00:24:28,431
